DOFF hook was added\nG. Test results\nH. Any blocker\n\nNEXT ROUTE:\nLuce verification only if implementation materially changes shared runtime behavior.\nOtherwise return directly to Don for use.\n```\n\nOne thing I tightened from the draft you pasted: **the pointer should be project-local, not one global `.gce\\handoff-latest.txt`.** Once you have several isolated DevPads running, a global “latest” would eventually open the wrong project's handoff. Project-local keeps the behavior aligned with the architecture you're already building."]}, "create_time": 1790369465.938316, "end_turn": true, "id": "1d84ca80-af9c-4ab0-9392-dc7cd01ef684", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "code_blocks": {"0": {"edited": false, "id": "5j0mdl", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}}, "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "7b82036b-fc45-4333-a435-44026edcfad2", "request_id": "b53248d2-987b-46b4-9ab9-e45218ae1471", "resolved_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "search_result_groups": [], "story_events": [], "thinking_effort": "standard", "turn_exchange_id": "0c046fd2-04cd-4d33-b7cd-5b588ddb1ff2", "working_turn_id": "0c046fd2-04cd-4d33-b7cd-5b588ddb1ff2"}, "recipient": "all", "status": "finished_successfully", "update_time": 1790381564.96161, "weight": 1}, {"author": {"metadata": {}, "name": null, "role": "user"}, "channel": null, "content": {"content_type": "text", "parts": ["Okay."]}, "create_time": 1790380118.056818, "end_turn": null, "id": "ebef6b48-e25c-44bb-9284-26e01f548f71", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "dictation": true, "dictation_asset_format": "m4a", "dictation_asset_pointer": "sediment://file_0000000026688230aa809e677f5d57e1