NICO.md\n\nDRIVE_HANDOFF:\n<Google Drive URL once Cable Car publishes it>\n\nLOCAL_OPEN:\n<local actionable/open reference once implemented>\n\nDRIVE_ARTIFACT_ID:\n<Drive file ID if available>\n\nCABLE_CAR_STATE:\nPUBLISHED | QUEUED | RECEIVED | NONE\n```\n\nNow we're separating **human session state** from **machine routing state**.\n\nThat's the right boundary.\n\n---\n\n# The handoff itself\n\nEvery real handoff should eventually give you **both sides**:\n\n### Human / cloud copy\n\n```text\nOPEN IN GOOGLE DRIVE:\n[HANDOFF]\n```\n\nThat points to the persistent copy Cable Car published.\n\n### Machine / local copy\n\n```text\nOPEN LOCAL HANDOFF:\nC:\\Users\\Dekan AI Brother\\GCE_DON\\...\\handoff.md\n```\n\nAnd eventually the DevPad/OpenCode surface can render:\n\n```text\n[ OPEN LOCAL ]    [ OPEN DRIVE ]\n```\n\nThose are two representations of the **same handoff ID**.\n\nThat's important.\n\nWe should **not** have “the local handoff” and “the Drive handoff” as conceptually different artifacts.\n\nIt should be:\n\n```text\nHANDOFF_ID\n    │\n    ├── LOCAL_PATH\n    └── DRIVE_ARTIFACT_ID / DRIVE_URL\n```\n\nSo Cable Car is transport/persistence, not an artifact duplication model.\n\n---\n\n# Full assembled example\n\nHere's what I think an actual session should look like:\n\n```text\n==================================================\nGCE SESSION HEADER\n==================================================\n\nTIMESTAMP:            2026-09-25 16:56 PT\nAUTHORITY:            Don\nPRIMARY SEAT:         Coda\nOCCUPANT / MODEL:     GPT-5.6 Sol\nMODE:                 RECONCILIATION\nCURRENT THREAD:       Framework Taxonomy / Routing Reconciliation\nCURRENT CONTEXT:      Reconciling live machine state against frozen Framework\n                      authority before the Nico implementation pass.\nMATURITY:             DEVELOPMENT\nSTATUS:               ACTIVE\nCONFIDENCE:           97%\nCURRENT ANCHOR:       Luce current-state reconciliation\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nACTIVE CONTEXT APPENDIX\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPROMOTED / CURRENT:\n- Framework Taxonomy / Routing Reconciliation\n\nPARKED:\n- Cable Car / Drive transport\n- Session Controller / Carousel\n- Open Handoff utility\n- Mobile Orchestration / Vomit Runtime\n\n==================================================\n... SESSION WORK ...\n==================================================\n\n==================================================\nGCE SESSION FOOTER\n==================================================\n\nSEAT:                 Coda\nSESSION STATUS:       CHECKPOINT\nOUTCOME:              Reconciliation accepted and bounded Nico package prepared.\nCONFIDENCE:           97%\n\nDECISIONS:\n- Project owns project-specific artifacts.\n- Routing destination does not determine artifact ownership.\n\nBLOCKERS:\n- Current machine reconciliation must complete before execution.\n\nOPEN ITEMS:\n- Reconcile live roster/bootstrap residue.\n\nNEXT ROUTE:           Nico\nNEXT ACTION:          Execute accepted correction package.\n\nHANDOFF:              GCE-HO-20260925-0042\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nROUTING / HANDOFF APPENDIX\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nPROJECT:              GCE_Framework\nWORKSTREAM:           Taxonomy_Reconciliation\nSESSION_ID:           20260925-CODA-001\n\nCURRENT_SEAT:         Coda\nNEXT_ROUTE:           Nico\nAFTER_PASS:           Luce\nFINAL_GATE:           Don\n\nGATE:                 implementation\nBLOCKER_ROUTE:        Don/Coda\n\nHANDOFF_ID:           GCE-HO-20260925-0042\nHANDOFF_TYPE:         governance_to_implementation\n\nLOCAL_HANDOFF_PATH:\nC:\\Users\\Dekan AI Brother\\...\\20260925-CODA-TO-NICO.md\n\nDRIVE_HANDOFF_URL:\n<published URL>\n\nDRIVE_ARTIFACT_ID:\n<Drive ID>\n\nCABLE_CAR_STATE:      PUBLISHED\n```\n\n## One more thing I would freeze\n\n**Promotion is explicit.**\n\nWhenever we change subjects inside a long-running chat, we update only:\n\n```text\nCURRENT THREAD\nCURRENT CONTEXT\nPROMOTED / CURRENT\nPARKED\n```\n\nEverything else keeps its identity.\n\nThat gives us exactly what you're after: **you and I can bounce between three or four workstreams without the session itself losing its operating frame.**\n\nAnd the **handoff appendix becomes the bridge to Cable Car/OpenCode**, rather than bloating the human-readable footer."]}, "create_time": 1790380898.073362, "end_turn": true, "id": "016f01bf-ac06-4af4-9a26-65b8c7862cd1", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "code_blocks": {"0": {"edited": false, "id": "pdrtz8", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "1": {"edited": false, "id": "zw8zjl", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "10": {"edited": false, "id": "5zeabx", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "2": {"edited": false, "id": "jj9acm", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "3": {"edited": false, "id": "6e8yu9", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "4": {"edited": false, "id": "eojqas", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "5": {"edited": false, "id": "4yve8o", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "6": {"edited": false, "id": "s0do9k", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "7": {"edited": false, "id": "0lwlhv", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "8": {"edited": false, "id": "tmn6gh", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}, "9": {"edited": false, "id": "8xlzrc", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}}, "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "66e16803-2451-4d24-8adb-d5588d161510", "request_id": "f8172858-b27e-45fd-a42d-f7fc5