nd remain intact as provenance.\n\n### Canonical Drive artifact\n\nurlOpen GCE Session Frame V3 in Google Drivehttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1XZ1bRCVIsFJpyGbn291Jagci0ny8zhR8VzVN62fy5kI/edit?usp=drivesdk\n\nSo **yes: moving forward, V3 is the session Header/Footer canon**. The older header/footer structures remain historical evidence, not competing current standards.\n\nAnd this sets us up cleanly for what you said next: **now we can drop the anchor.**"]}, "create_time": 1790381262.7135, "end_turn": true, "id": "88ec8f6a-aaea-48f5-b3f8-824496ea62e7", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [{"alt": "[Open GCE Session Frame V3 in Google Drive](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XZ1bRCVIsFJpyGbn291Jagci0ny8zhR8VzVN62fy5kI/edit?usp=drivesdk&utm_source=chatgpt.com)", "end_idx": 2200, "item": {"attribution": "docs.google.com", "attribution_segments": null, "attributions": null, "hue": null, "pub_date": null, "refs": [], "snippet": null, "supporting_websites": null, "title": "Open GCE Session Frame V3 in Google Drive", "url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XZ1bRCVIsFJpyGbn291Jagci0ny8zhR8VzVN62fy5kI/edit?usp=drivesdk&utm_source=chatgpt.com"}, "layout": null, "logo": null, "matched_text": "urlOpen GCE Session Frame V3 in Google Drivehttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1XZ1bRCVIsFJpyGbn291Jagci0ny8zhR8VzVN62fy5kI/edit?usp=drivesdk", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": "[Open GCE Session Frame V3 in Google Drive](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XZ1bRCVIsFJpyGbn291Jagci0ny8zhR8VzVN62fy5kI/edit?usp=drivesdk&utm_source=chatgpt.com)", "refs": [], "safe_urls": [], "start_idx": 2055, "title": "Open GCE Session Frame V3 in Google Drive", "type": "url"}], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug"