100%>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCOMPLETED:\\r\\n- <completed item>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nNOT COMPLETED:\\r\\n- <unfinished item or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nBLOCKERS:\\r\\n- <actual blocker or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nNEXT ROUTE:           <requesting seat / specialist / Don / NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nNEXT ACTION:\\r\\n<one precise next action>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nHANDOFF:\\r\\n<handoff id/path or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRUNTIME SESSION STATE ARTIFACT:\\r\\n<state artifact id/path>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n2. OBJECTIVE / ACCEPTANCE CLOSE\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nENTRY OBJECTIVE:\\r\\n<objective at assignment start>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nEXIT OBJECTIVE STATE:\\r\\n<ACHIEVED | PARTIAL | BLOCKED | CHANGED | SUPERSEDED>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nACCEPTANCE CONDITION:\\r\\n<expected proof of completion>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nACCEPTANCE RESULT:\\r\\n<PASS | FAIL | PARTIAL | NOT OBSERVABLE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCURRENT OBJECTIVE AT EXIT:\\r\\n<current objective>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nOBJECTIVE DELTA:\\r\\n<NONE or material change>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nDRIFT STATUS:\\r\\n<ALIGNED | REQUEST CHANGED | SCOPE CHANGED |\\r\\n INPUT CHANGED | STATE CHANGED | UNKNOWN>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n3. EVIDENCE RETURN\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nEVIDENCE / ARTIFACTS PRODUCED:\\r\\n- <path/id/result>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROVENANCE:\\r\\n- <source>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nOBSERVED FACTS:\\r\\n- <fact>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nUNKNOWN:\\r\\n- <unknown or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCONFLICT:\\r\\n- <conflict or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRULE:\\r\\nReport observations separately from inference.\\r\\nThe requesting seat cannot dictate the service result.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n4. FAILURE / DEFECT CLOSE\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nFAILURES:\\r\\n- <failure or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nATTEMPTS:\\r\\n<count / summary>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nWORKAROUND:\\r\\n<workaround or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nUNDERLYING DEFECT STATUS:\\r\\n<OPEN | FIXED | DEFERRED | PARKED | NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nOWNER / NEXT ROUTE:\\r\\n<seat / Don / NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRULE:\\r\\nNo silent failure.\\r\\nNo silent workaround.\\r\\nWorkaround does not erase defect state.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n5. BOUNDARY / HELP CLOSE\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSERVICE BOUNDARY HIT:\\r\\n<YES | NO>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nIF YES:\\r\\nBOUNDARY:\\r\\n<what exceeded service authority>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRECOMMENDED EXPERTISE:\\r\\n<seat/expertise>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nQUESTION TO ROUTE:\\r\\n<exact question>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSERVICE POSITION:\\r\\n<what the service can still provide without overreach>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n6. ROUTING / HANDOFF APPENDIX\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROJECT:              <project>\\r\\nWORKSTREAM:           <workstream>\\r\\nREQUESTING_SEAT:      <seat / Don>\\r\\nCURRENT_SEAT:         <service seat>\\r\\nNEXT_ROUTE:           <seat / Don / NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nGATE:                 <gate>\\r\\nBLOCKER_ROUTE:        <seat / Don / NONE>\\r\\nCURRENT_ANCHOR:       <artifact/state pointer>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nHANDOFF_ID:           <stable id or NONE>\\r\\nHANDOFF_TYPE:         <type or NONE>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nLOCAL_HANDOFF_PATH:   <path or NONE>\\r\\nDRIVE_HANDOFF_URL:    <url or NONE>\\r\\nDRIVE_ARTIFACT_ID:    <id or NONE>\\r\\nCABLE_CAR_STATE:      <NONE | QUEUED | PUBLISHED | RECEIVED | ERROR>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n7. STATE MATERIALIZATION RULE\\r\\n==================================================\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nAt meaningful lifecycle boundaries, materialize/update the Runtime Session State Artifact.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMinimum expected boundaries:\\r\\n- 