th | Function | Authority / Owner | Classification | Disposition |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `GCE_ORG\\` | Organizational/governance structure; durable Framework functions | Don / Coda | **LIVE** | **KEEP** |\n| `GCE_IDENTITY\\` | Live seat identities, AGENTS, bootstrap identity | Don; seat-specific authority | **LIVE** | **KEEP** |\n| `GCE_DON\\` | Don operating floor; live working surfaces/apps/project support | Don | **LIVE** | **KEEP** |\n| `Projects\\` | Project lifecycle and implementation truth | Project authority under Don | **LIVE** | **KEEP** |\n| Historical / frozen / archive surfaces | Provenance and superseded state | Historical authority only | **HISTORICAL** | **KEEP / protect** |\n| `GCE_DON\\GCE_Framework\\` | Current + historical Framework authority surface | Don / Coda | **LIVE but structurally incomplete** | **REPAIR SURFACE** |\n| `...\\GCE_Framework\\GCE_FRAMEWORK_HANDOFF_NEW_CHAT_2026-09-20.docx` | Reset/handoff provenance from prior era | Historical Coda/Framework state | **HISTORICAL** | **SUPERSEDE AS CURRENT, PRESERVE IN PLACE** |\n| Functional Framework estates such as Strategic Governance, Technical Strategy, Architecture, Operations, Implementation, Shared Enterprise Services | Durable responsibility domains | Current appropriate seats/functions | **Potentially LIVE** | **KEEP unless review proves authority ambiguity** |\n| GCE Stack | Technical support/platform project | Project ownership; Framework governs only authority boundary | **PROJECT / partially materialized** | **MATERIALIZE PARENT, then map components** |\n| Framework Reconciliation | Stale-chat intake, authority/artifact reconciliation | Don / Coda | **PROJECT / handoff only** | **MATERIALIZE PARENT** |\n| Model Testing | Model-evaluation research and registry | Technical Strategy / Framework research | **WORKSTREAM** | **CREATE REGISTRY, not standalone project by default** |\n| VoiceBridge technical implementation | Capture/voice technical component | GCE Stack | **PROJECT